for the local market.

00:03:09.470 --> 00:03:11.660
Maybe there's international
coffee companies

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:16.830
sourcing coffee from all
over the world, basically.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:21.290
And we work with those companies
to improve the business models,

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:26.660
that interaction, say, between
these companies that source

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:30.140
produce and the farmers
that produce it.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.640
Because often, many
