00:54:06.760 --> 00:54:08.840
And many people are very kind.

00:54:08.840 --> 00:54:10.445
They'll also say,
this isn't working.

00:54:10.445 --> 00:54:11.320
This is the new link.

00:54:11.320 --> 00:54:13.060
So my work is super easy.

00:54:13.060 --> 00:54:20.260
So I'd say that's where people
are being really helpful helps.

00:54:20.260 --> 00:54:23.320
And let's say, keeping up
