00:54:51.910 --> 00:54:53.320
Where does it go?

00:54:53.320 --> 00:54:55.180
What should the introduction be?

00:54:55.180 --> 00:54:56.990
That takes a lot of
time to do all of that.

00:54:56.990 --> 00:54:59.110
So I've drafted in a
bit of help because it

00:54:59.110 --> 00:55:02.520
was getting a bit much.

00:55:02.520 --> 00:55:03.830
Yeah.

00:55:03.830 --> 00:55:05.210
Great.

