if you want a video course.

00:55:36.050 --> 00:55:37.550
So, actually, on
the Big Book of R,

00:55:37.550 --> 00:55:39.830
there's a Big Book of R
slash Start Here I think,

00:55:39.830 --> 00:55:41.900
which is, indeed,
if you are very new,

00:55:41.900 --> 00:55:43.290
they are the two resources.

00:55:43.290 --> 00:55:46.340
One is the book, and one's
a series of free videos

00:55:46.340 --> 00:55:51.620
from all R the rest of us
