get a lot of use and power

00:56:07.110 --> 00:56:11.050
out of it, and I'm 20
times more productive.

00:56:11.050 --> 00:56:13.110
So I think if you're
a beginner from R,

00:56:13.110 --> 00:56:15.810
I mean, I did half
of the R for DS book.

00:56:15.810 --> 00:56:18.420
And it's been insanely useful
